          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lamabu'uungwí tseegeek, harmagahheek, daqaní tari dabér hota dír eeharuuser'eene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ un daamaaraám, kudá' aa nahhaat dír xwaylár Yakobowo, inós un harahhiíf.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ga/aaweek, aníng nee na/iiká' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ naa haniís a laya nee waa/oo/amo baraá Israeliwo ar amór AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Aleesleemusmoó daáhh, kudá' gawaá tloomár Siyonír hoót. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee qoomár burna bayé', «Tlawé' gi'i yaahamisuú awaak, nee muruú /ayma'aá mululu'uúm adór tsir/o, asma i qoón muu munguii'ín ngiwa yaahamisiya', nee múk aa qaatl kuwa yaahamiisi as múk slaáf.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' inooín ki beera', «Gár Mungú kuungá' nuwa intsaahhatamiisi na iiárií qaasaak, gi'i mi iiárií qamimara', asma gár hhoo' ngi aain'aaká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muu baraá yaamuwo tan tawo tambeeruus, taa ló'wa amoqwaár, slamí qwariitiyá'. Slám bir qwariitiyá' mune gaa farkiín amór waawutmooín nee munguine. Tan gawaá doorí qaytsiit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ga/aawaak, tam yaamu kiri xuuxuu', ala gár ta ari aqo slahh'amu, nee giwti nee ma/amír aa qipit, inooín kiri tliwii/ baraá ma/amír hhamhhám.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
